# Default: do not guess. Git only converts line endings where told to below.
* -text

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OTA-signed bundle files: NEVER convert line endings.
#
# The OTA signature covers the SHA-256 of these files' exact bytes.
# sign-ota.ps1 hashes the WORKING-TREE bytes, while the device hashes the bytes
# raw.githubusercontent.com serves (i.e. the bytes stored in the repo). Any
# LF<->CRLF conversion between those two makes the hashes disagree and every
# update is rejected with "подпись OTA-бандла недействительна".
#
# `-text` above already disables conversion repo-wide; these entries are listed
# explicitly so the requirement is obvious and survives edits to this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
mobile/www/index.html   -text
mobile/www/app.js       -text
mobile/www/styles.css   -text
mobile/www/version.json -text
version.json            -text

# Binaries must never be touched.
*.apk      binary
*.idsig    binary
*.jpg      binary
*.jpeg     binary
*.png      binary
*.keystore binary
*.der      binary
*.pem      -text
